<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan third round oilfield bidding details.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan third round oilfield bidding details.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the bidding sequence in Venezuela's third oil operating licensing round, with the bid deadline in local time (GMT minus 4 hours), an estimate of oil reserves in place, and the &quot;minimum work obligation&quot; cost for each field, according to Petroleos de Venezuela documents.</p>
<p>FIELD		  DEADLINE    RESERVES   MINIMUM WORK</p>
<p>							OBLIGATION</p>
<p>			(Local Time) (MMBbls)   ($ Million)</p>
<p>MONDAY JUNE 2</p>
<p> Kaki		   0900	   672	    7</p>
<p> Casma-Anaco	  1100	   260	    6</p>
<p> Mata		   1400	   951	    8</p>
<p> Maulpa		 1600	   606	    5</p>
<p> Acema		  1800	   324	    5</p>
<p>TUESDAY JUNE 3</p>
<p> Intercampo N.	0900	  1799	   24</p>
<p> La Concepcion	1100	  1458	   26</p>
<p> B2X-68/79	    1400	  1233	   12</p>
<p> Mene Grande	  1600	  2634	   20</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY JUNE 4</p>
<p> LL-652		 0900	  2482	   45</p>
<p> Ambrosio	     1100	  1249	   27</p>
<p> Cretacico Sur	1400	   296	   50</p>
<p> Caracoles	    1600	  1065	   12</p>
<p>THURSDAY JUNE 5</p>
<p> Dacion		 0900	  2223	   16</p>
<p> La Vela		1100	   319	   50</p>
<p> B2X-70/80	    1400	  1125	   17</p>
<p> Cabimas		1600	  2158	   40</p>
<p>FRIDAY JUNE 6</p>
<p> Onado		  0900	   474	   10</p>
<p> Bachaquero S.O.    1100	    63	   14</p>
<p> Boqueron	     1400	   429	   13</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2611))</p>
